## Next Steps for Production
To enable analytics in production:
1. Navigate to the Vercel project dashboard
2. Go to the Analytics section
3. Click "Enable Web Analytics"
4. Deploy the application to Vercel
5. Analytics data will start appearing after visitor traffic

## Notes
- The application requires `DATABASE_URL` environment variable for a full production build
- This is expected and doesn't affect Analytics functionality
- Analytics will automatically inject tracking on deployment to Vercel
- No additional configuration needed in the code
